{
  "_comment": "Home-button wiring for lnx-server (1920x1080): persistent top-left home badge opens the view grid; dead-zone taps do nothing. Copy to touch.json on the host and edit only device/endpoint: confirm device with `python3 touch.py --list-devices`. Home entry is generated -- never hand-edit it; recompute with: python3 renderers/home_chrome.py --width <W> --height <H> (paste FIRST under \"regions\": earlier entries win overlaps). Tile rects are generated with: python3 renderers/picker.py --width <W> --height <H> --views <csv>. tap_options is OFF: the badge replaces the tap-anywhere fallback. Revert: restore the backup (see TOUCH.md \"Home button\").",
